==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a spammable Area Attacker such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] for the Otta-smack-us and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] for The Face.

